%tokens NUMBER VARIABLE PLUS MINUS MULT DIV LPAREN RPAREN FUNCTION EXP EQUALS

S -> E EQUALS E *Equation | E *Passthrough
E -> E PLUS T *Binary | E MINUS T *Binary | T *Passthrough
T -> T MULT U *Binary | T DIV U *Binary | T F *Implicit | U *Passthrough
U -> MINUS U *Unary | PLUS U *Unary | F *Passthrough
F -> P EXP U *Binary | P *Passthrough
P -> FUNCTION LPAREN E RPAREN *Function
P -> LPAREN E RPAREN *Parenthesized | NUMBER *Leaf | VARIABLE *Leaf